  { q: 'How long does it take to get a death certificate in UP?', a: 'When the application is complete and verification goes smoothly, the certificate is usually issued within 7 to 15 working days. Delays are most common when the death was registered late or when a document is unclear, because those cases need an extra round of checking by the local registrar office.' },
